{"step_index":1216,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:32:36Z","input_tokens":2342,"cache_read_tokens":237743,"output_tokens":522,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# Decision Record: Monolithic Autonomous Mastermind Architecture\n\n**Date**: 2026-10-20\n**Context**: The user requested stripping away the cluttered multi-mode UI (Copy Trading / Quant Regime / Hermes Desk) into a single, clean, monolithic \"Autonomous Mastermind Beast\" that trains 24/7, while retaining the satisfying motion animations and agent avatars from the original viral Grok Bot video.\n\n## Key Architectural Decisions\n1. **Consolidated Engine**:\n   - Merge the 7-agent committee (`Atlas`, `Lumen`, `Hydra`, `Sentinel`, `Hephaestus`, `Mnemosyne`, `Hermes`) into internal cognitive lobes of the Mastermind.\n   - Strip all mode switcher buttons from the top bar. The Mastermind runs automatically.\n2. **Visual & Motion Design (Vibe-Coding by Pixel)**:\n   - Central **Pulsing Neural Core**: Visual glowing brain orb with live thoughts ticker (`Absorbing order book imbalance...`, `Hydra scored A+ (94/100)...`, `Lumen clear of CPI news...`).\n   - Retain the **Top 4 Metric Cards**: Balance (progress bar), Total P&L, Active Agent Operator with satisfying neon LED win/loss pills (`W`/`L`), and the 2-Strike Handbrake Lockout (`0/2` tactile boxes).\n   - Retain the **Stepped Equity Canvas**: Satisfying neon stairs with avatar handover flags.\n   - Retain the **Bottom Agent Carousel**: Smooth animated sliding cards with `FOLLOWING` cyan glow, `FIRED` red lockout stamp, and `BENCH` status.\n3. **Self-Evolution & Neural IQ**:\n   - Mastermind trains continuously, gaining XP, ascending levels (Level 1 to 100), and autonomously tuning Bayesian weights.\n","Description":"Log Monolithic Mastermind architecture decision","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/dev/.gemini/decisions/raw/2026-10-20-monolithic-mastermind.md","toolAction":"Logg