{"step_index":1222,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:33:00Z","input_tokens":2567,"cache_read_tokens":238669,"output_tokens":3987,"thinking":"Focus is now on designing the UI components for the \"Monolithic Autonomous Mastermind.\" The core component, `MastermindCore.tsx`, will be a unified console representing the system's central nervous system, visualized as a pulsing neural monolith. This will replace the current multi-tab approach.\n\n\nRefinement of the UI design begins with the `Header.tsx` component. The design prioritizes a clean, minimalist aesthetic. Unnecessary mode switchers are being removed to reduce visual clutter and emphasize the core functionality.\n\nThe header will clearly display the system's identity and operational status. Live performance metrics, including speed multipliers and an autonomy indicator, will be incorporated for instant visibility.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React from 'react';\nimport { EvolutionState, HermesCommittee } from '../types';\nimport { Brain, Zap, Shield, Sparkles, Activity, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';\n\ninterface MastermindCoreProps {\n  evolution: EvolutionState;\n  committee: HermesCommittee;\n  currentThought: string;\n}\n\nexport const MastermindCore: React.FC<MastermindCoreProps> = ({\n  evolution,\n  committee,\n  currentThought\n}) => {\n  const xpPercent = Math.min(100, Math.round((evolution.xp / evolution.nextLevelXp) * 100));\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"relative p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0c1024] via-[#090d1f] to-[#070914] border border-indigo-500/30 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(99,102,241,0.12)] overflow-hidden\">\n      {/* Ambient background glows */}\n      <div className=\"absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-purple-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1/2 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-400/60 to-transparent\" />\n\n      {/* Top Bar: Mastermind Identity & Level Ascension */}\n      <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n          {/* Pulsing Neural Core Orb */}\n          <div className=\"relative\">\n            <div className=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 via-cyan-500 to-purple-600 p-0.5 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <div className=\"w-full h-full bg-[#080b18] rounded-[14px] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <Brain className=\"w-7 h-7 text-cyan-300 animate-pulse\" />\n                <span className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400/10 rounded-full animate-ping pointer-events-none\" />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <span className=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-mono font-black bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-indigo-400 text-slate-950 shadow\">\n              LVL {evolution.level}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <h2 className=\"font-display font-extrabold text-lg text-white tracking-wide flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                AUTONOMOUS MASTERMIND\n              </h2>\n              <span className=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40 animate-pulse\">\n                SELF-TRAINING 24/7\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span>{evolution.title}</span>\n              <span className=\"text-slate-600\">•</span>\n              <span className=\"text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">{evolution.winStreak} Win Streak</span>\n              <span className=\"text-slate-600\">•</span>\n              <span className=\"text-slate-300\">{evolution.totalTrades} Learned Decisions</span>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Neural XP Meter */}\n        <div className=\"min-w-[260px] p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800/80\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono mb-1.5\">\n            <span className=\"text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <Sparkles className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\" /> Neural Evolution\n            </span>\n            <span className=\"text-white font-bold\">\n              {evolution.xp} <span className=\"text-slate-500\">/ {evolution.nextLevelXp} XP</span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 overflow-hidden\">\n            <div\n              className=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-cyan-400 to-emerald-400 rounded-full transition-all duration-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(56,189,248,0.5)]\"\n              style={{ width: `${xpPercent}%` }}\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Middle: 7 Internal Cognitive Lobes (Firing Silently in Parallel) */}\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-2.5 my-4\">\n        {/* Atlas Lobe */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 text-center\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Activity className=\"w-3 h-3 text-blue-400\" /> Macro Lobe\n          </div>\n          <div className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold mt-1 ${\n            committee.atlas.bias === 'BULLISH' ? 'text-emerald-400' :\n            committee.atlas.bias === 'BEARISH' ? 'text-rose-400' : 'text-slate-300'\n          }`}>\n            {committee.atlas.bias}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">{committee.atlas.confidence}% conf</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Lumen Lobe */}\n        <div className={`p-2 rounded-xl border text-center transition-colors ${\n          committee.lumen.isLocked\n            ? 'bg-rose-950/30 border-rose-500/50 text-rose-300 animate-pulse'\n            : 'bg-slate-900/50 border-slate-800/80'\n        }`}>\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Shield className=\"w-3 h-3 text-amber-400\" /> News Shield\n          </div>\n          <div className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold mt-1 ${committee.lumen.isLocked ? 'text-rose-400' : 'text-emerald-400'}`}>\n            {committee.lumen.isLocked ? 'LOCKED' : 'CLEAR'}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5 truncate\">{committee.lumen.minutesUntil}m until news</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Hydra Lobe */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 text-center\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <CheckCircle2 className=\"w-3 h-3 text-cyan-400\" /> Setup Grader\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-cyan-300 mt-1\">\n            {committee.hydra.setupGrade} ({committee.hydra.score}/100)\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">&gt;70 threshold</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Sentinel Lobe */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 text-center\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Shield className=\"w-3 h-3 text-purple-400\" /> Risk Armor\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-300 mt-1\">\n            0.75% Locked\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">{committee.sentinel.consecutiveLosses}/2 strikes</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Hephaestus Lobe */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 text-center\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Zap className=\"w-3 h-3 text-orange-400\" /> Order Slip\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-orange-300 mt-1 truncate\">\n            {committee.hephaestus.action} {committee.hephaestus.instrument}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">1:3.0 R:R</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Mnemosyne Lobe */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 text-center\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Sparkles className=\"w-3 h-3 text-teal-400\" /> Memory Vault\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-teal-300 mt-1\">\n            {committee.mnemosyne.winRate}% WR\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">{committee.mnemosyne.totalApproved} approved</div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Hermes Executive Core */}\n        <div className=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-950/80 to-purple-950/80 border border-indigo-500/40 text-center col-span-2 sm:col-span-1\">\n          <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-1\">\n            <Brain className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Mastermind\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold text-white mt-1\">\n            AUTONOMOUS\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-emerald-400 mt-0.5\">Execution Active</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Bottom: Live Stream of Consciousness (Internal Dialogue) */}\n      <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800/90 flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-cyan-300 shrink-0\">\n          <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping\" />\n          NEURAL THOUGHT\n        </div>\n        <p className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 truncate\">\n          {currentThought || committee.hermes.summary}\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n","Description":"Create MastermindCore.tsx uniting the 7 lobes into a sleek, monolithic neural console","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/components/MastermindCore.tsx","toolAction":"Creating MastermindCore.tsx","toolSummary":"Create MastermindCore component"}}]}
